{"id":4086,"date":"2025-06-03T02:45:50","date_gmt":"2025-06-03T02:45:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4086"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:22:57","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:22:57","slug":"15-cach-xay-kenh-tiktok-len-xu-huong","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/15-cach-xay-kenh-tiktok-len-xu-huong\/","title":{"rendered":"15 c\u00e1ch x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh TikTok nhanh ch\u00f3ng, d\u1ec5 l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng."},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"FcVidyRfYo3RwLxIOUDl9GFIgWb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sf4UdTHLhoVxjpx6JFOlJNSpg9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1ch x\u00e2y k\u00eanh TikTok l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea1o, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok nh\u1eb1m m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 15 c\u00e1ch x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh TikTok nhanh ch\u00f3ng, d\u1ec5 l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><b>Lemon Digital<\/b><\/a>\u00a0kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay nh\u00e9!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTZcdDfako3igvxGf2ulSr3agOf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UhdsdByxeoELpIxOJEnl01W4gFg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u00fd do t\u1ea1i sao ph\u1ea3i x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh TikTok b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QYy1dF5JJoz2P2xcSp3l6ks1gzb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh TikTok b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng gi\u00fap ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng, t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1 nh\u1edd n\u1ed9i dung ng\u1eafn, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, d\u1ec5 viral. N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y c\u00f2n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao, chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p v\u00e0 t\u00edch h\u1ee3p TikTok Shop, gi\u00fap b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4089\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4089\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4089\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30.png\" alt=\"X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4089\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"FcVidyRfYo3RwLxIOUDl9GFIgWb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VR5fduQGEoGssoxKvIjlUmrNgke\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1ch x\u00e2y k\u00eanh TikTok &#8220;Tri\u1ec7u View&#8221;<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. \u0110\u1eb7t m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 cho k\u00eanh<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PVmddOPSaowM8gxX6d2lrPtTgog\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh r\u00f5 b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n x\u00e2y k\u00eanh h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec1u g\u00ec: b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, x\u00e2y th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, chia s\u1ebb ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c hay gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed. M\u1ed7i m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau s\u1ebd k\u00e9o theo m\u1ed9t phong c\u00e1ch n\u1ed9i dung, c\u00e1ch s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video, t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e0i v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kh\u00e1c nhau. V\u00ec v\u1eady, h\u00e3y r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb &#8220;l\u1ea1c h\u01b0\u1edbng&#8221;.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. Ch\u1ecdn ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VOg0dUzLKowNNrxHDYIlWogmgLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div>Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd chia s\u1ebb \u0111i\u1ec1u g\u00ec v\u1edbi c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng. \u0110\u1eebng ch\u1ecdn qu\u00e1 r\u1ed9ng \u2013 h\u00e3y ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111am m\u00ea ho\u1eb7c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n \u0111ang kinh doanh. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 g\u1ee3i \u00fd:<\/div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XegodVDlQoLmaQxicUjlWQiqgre\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m \u2192 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: tips skincare, make-up nhanh, review s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CetOdWg3xohT5kx38w4l8X0PgEb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n v\u1eb7t \u2192 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: \u0103n th\u1eed \u2013 review, quy tr\u00ecnh ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn, video ASMR \u0103n u\u1ed1ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J5RAdCs5joEcP8xbZFhltvLrgAe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 freelancer\/d\u1ea1y h\u1ecdc \u2192 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: chia s\u1ebb k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng, ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c, \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RRIWdsKBLoZES4xOpv8lF0oNggd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 ai l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn (\u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh, s\u1edf th\u00edch, th\u00f3i quen online). \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng. Vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm b\u1eaft t\u00e2m l\u00fd v\u00e0 h\u00e0nh vi gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u00fang nhu c\u1ea7u, t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc quan tr\u1ecdng trong vi\u1ec7c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n hay doanh nghi\u1ec7p tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4094\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4094\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4094\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-1.png\" alt=\"Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3, ch\u1ecdn th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/30-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4094\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3, ch\u1ecdn th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"FcVidyRfYo3RwLxIOUDl9GFIgWb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TSOsdBK6LoWemMxW7FqlH93ggLe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c k\u00eanh c\u00f9ng ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi c\u00e1ch h\u1ecd l\u00e0m n\u1ed9i dung, c\u00e1ch h\u1ecd gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng phong c\u00e1ch c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LrL0dRRJ3oaMfSx6rdXlBiOSgBh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: Kh\u00f4ng sao ch\u00e9p thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 t\u00ecm kho\u1ea3ng tr\u1ed1ng ch\u01b0a ai khai th\u00e1c, ho\u1eb7c bi\u1ebfn n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n th\u00e0nh phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n, g\u1ea7n g\u0169i h\u01a1n v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWlCdPfwfon3EexeQBwlMDwhgof\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch: TikTok search, TikTok Creative Center, ho\u1eb7c ph\u00e2n t\u00edch b\u1eb1ng m\u1eaft th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>5.\u00a0 \u0110\u1ecbnh h\u00ecnh phong c\u00e1ch n\u1ed9i dung<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MAVfdqncJo3ecqxS06Zl1luZgDd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u00e3y ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t phong c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n n\u1ed9i dung nh\u1ea5t qu\u00e1n nh\u01b0 h\u00e0i h\u01b0\u1edbc, gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c, review s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, chia s\u1ebb cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng (vlog), ho\u1eb7c truy\u1ec1n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng. Vi\u1ec7c duy tr\u00ec c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t &#8220;ch\u1ea5t ri\u00eang&#8221; trong t\u1eebng video s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, d\u1ec5 ghi nh\u1edb trong t\u00e2m tr\u00ed ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>6. Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi quay<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CwEVdh4h3oOItFxM2gflKZYJg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 quay d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t video, ch\u00fang ta h\u00e3y tham kh\u1ea3o b\u1ea3ng s\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 quy tr\u00ecnh quay d\u1ef1ng video TikTok do Lemon cung c\u1ea5p \u1edf b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jjqtdxc8SokhhIxwzS3lJHtBgwb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u1ea2NG S\u01a0 \u0110\u1ed2 QUY TR\u00ccNH QUAY D\u1ef0NG VIDEO TIKTOK<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Y2HwdfxfNo1CXgxqbMOl6333gOg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 99.4215%;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"208\" \/>\n<col width=\"440\" \/>\n<col width=\"279\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.6084%;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 49.8533%;\"><strong>N\u1ed9i dung c\u1ea7n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 77.6147%;\"><strong>M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6084%; text-align: left;\">1. Vi\u1ebft k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8533%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh n\u1ed9i dung ch\u00ednh (th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i)<br \/>\n&#8211; Vi\u1ebft theo c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac: M\u1edf \u2013 Th\u00e2n \u2013 K\u1ebft (Hook \u2013 N\u1ed9i dung \u2013 CTA)<br \/>\n&#8211; L\u00ean \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh minh h\u1ecda cho t\u1eebng \u0111o\u1ea1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.6147%; text-align: left;\">T\u1ea1o c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian quay, truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6084%; text-align: left;\">2. Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8533%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; \u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u00f3 camera t\u1ed1t<br \/>\n&#8211; Tripod ho\u1eb7c g\u1eady ch\u1ed1ng rung<br \/>\n&#8211; \u0110\u00e8n ring light ho\u1eb7c t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br \/>\n&#8211; Mic thu \u00e2m n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.6147%; text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 \u00e2m thanh r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6084%; text-align: left;\">3. Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb kh\u00f4ng gian v\u00e0 ngo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8533%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; Background g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng, s\u00e1ng s\u1ee7a<br \/>\n&#8211; Trang ph\u1ee5c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung<br \/>\n&#8211; \u00c1nh s\u00e1ng c\u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.6147%; text-align: left;\">T\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c, t\u0103ng t\u00ednh tin c\u1eady<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6084%; text-align: left;\">4. Quay video t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, ch\u00e2n th\u1eadt<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8533%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; Bi\u1ec3u c\u1ea3m sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng, gi\u1ecdng n\u00f3i r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng<br \/>\n&#8211; Ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef c\u01a1 th\u1ec3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<br \/>\n&#8211; Di\u1ec5n xu\u1ea5t nh\u01b0 \u0111ang tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.6147%; text-align: left;\">T\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i, gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem l\u00e2u h\u01a1n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6084%; text-align: left;\">5. D\u1ef1ng video h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8533%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; C\u1eaft b\u1ecf \u0111o\u1ea1n th\u1eeba, gi\u1eef nh\u1ecbp \u0111\u1ed9 nhanh<br \/>\n&#8211; Th\u00eam ch\u1eef ch\u1ea1y, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng, filter v\u1eeba ph\u1ea3i<br \/>\n&#8211; L\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1c trend ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung<br \/>\n&#8211; Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i \u00e2m thanh v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u0103ng<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.6147%; text-align: left;\">L\u00e0m video sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng, thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6084%; text-align: left;\">6. G\u1eafn Hashtag &amp; \u0110\u0103ng video<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8533%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; Hashtag \u0111\u00fang ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 (3\u20135 c\u00e1i)<br \/>\n&#8211; K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, hashtag trend v\u00e0 hashtag c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3)<br \/>\n&#8211; \u0110\u0103ng v\u00e0o khung gi\u1edd \u201cv\u00e0ng\u201d (th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 11h\u201313h ho\u1eb7c 19h\u201321h)<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.6147%; text-align: left;\">T\u1ed1i \u01b0u kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 viral c\u1ee7a video<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h3>\u00a0<\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>7. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads th\u00f4ng minh<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZyYdni5xoBWD5xwJXmlkxIeggf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Ads l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau. \u0110\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u01b0 In-Feed Ads, Spark Ads ho\u1eb7c Top View t\u00f9y v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u0103ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1ebd gi\u00fap t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i. Theo d\u00f5i s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi c\u0169ng l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o..<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4093\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4093\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4093\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34.png\" alt=\"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads th\u00f4ng minh, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4093\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads th\u00f4ng minh, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"FcVidyRfYo3RwLxIOUDl9GFIgWb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>8. T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o In-feed v\u00e0 Hashtag Challenge<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NhxXdwOMmoKbMGxIF4jlziEZgzY\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t hashtag ri\u00eang, d\u1ec5 nh\u1edb, d\u1ec5 \u0111\u00e1nh v\u1ea7n s\u1ebd gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng h\u01a1n. N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u1ea1i trong c\u00e1c video c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd, hashtag \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ebd c\u00f3 hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng lan truy\u1ec1n m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1n qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>9. T\u1ea1o Hashtag ri\u00eang cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gwyjdju0CoznOxxQfxjljlRLg8l\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 gi\u00fap t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng tr\u00ean TikTok. Khi t\u1ea1o hashtag ri\u00eang, h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o n\u00f3 ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, d\u1ec5 nh\u1edb, li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\/d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang. Khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag trong th\u1eed th\u00e1ch, video review hay n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o s\u1ebd gi\u00fap lan t\u1ecfa th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng lan truy\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>10. S\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung mang l\u1ea1i gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A1U0dzu8JoS8NSxfStVlqfIfgZf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u00f9 l\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed, gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c, chia s\u1ebb ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c hay truy\u1ec1n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok s\u1ebd y\u00eau th\u00edch video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n n\u1ebfu n\u00f3 th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 mang l\u1ea1i gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb. Khi n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n h\u1eefu \u00edch, ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng chia s\u1ebb, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i k\u00eanh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>11.\u00a0 \u0110\u0103ng video v\u00e0o khung gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O2YkdG52woFsivxORxKloJhWgBe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng khung gi\u1edd m\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng m\u1ea1nh nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OccedJcBnojubLxc9sdl7ITvgUc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5: 6h\u20138h s\u00e1ng (gi\u1edd \u0111\u1ea7u ng\u00e0y), 11h\u201312h tr\u01b0a (gi\u1edd ngh\u1ec9 tr\u01b0a), 7h\u20139h t\u1ed1i (gi\u1edd gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed) \u0110\u0103ng v\u00e0o khung gi\u1edd n\u00e0y s\u1ebd t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng video b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok \u0111\u1ea9y l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>12. G\u1eafn hashtag th\u00f4ng minh<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HjjudUaWooYiXjxhb2xl0yfkg5g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p 3 nh\u00f3m hashtag: K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn + hashtag ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 + hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VAJwdLPItoOg6txfcehlm8Hug0b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn (#fyp, #viral, #tiktokvn\u2026)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ou0NdIQAIoIFI5xw5YFloh7FgPe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Hashtag theo ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng (#chamsocda, #thucphamkho, #thoitrang\u2026)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F1G2dToEOog4aYxWxEKlakftgjf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ri\u00eang (#BunRieuLemon, #LemonDigitalTips\u2026) Gi\u00fap video d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y v\u00e0 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4095\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4095\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4095\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-1.png\" alt=\"G\u1eafn hashtag th\u00f4ng minh, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4095\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">G\u1eafn hashtag th\u00f4ng minh, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>13. T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S7RldwSyboEt7SxtJijllQ7Zgdh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 l\u00e0 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem khi gh\u00e9 th\u0103m k\u00eanh b\u1ea1n. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00ean t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n, ti\u1ec3u s\u1eed (bio), v\u00e0 li\u00ean k\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec1u th\u1ed1ng nh\u1ea5t v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh r\u00f5 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. N\u1ebfu c\u00f3 th\u1ec3, d\u1eabn link v\u1ec1 landing page, TikTok Shop ho\u1eb7c website s\u1ebd t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>14. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JTbwd1bwao0A61xSXvelZTVygsc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, th\u1ea3 tim, nh\u1eafn tin ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i hay th\u1eadm ch\u00ed l\u00e0 l\u00e0m video tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi comment \u2013 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng s\u1ef1 th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n, t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>15. L\u01b0u \u00fd \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng video<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PFWidvLDHoWQZ8xXkPHlNCNygQe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Video TikTok n\u00ean ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn t\u1eeb (10\u201330 gi\u00e2y), g\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong <strong>3 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem kh\u00f4ng l\u01b0\u1edbt qua. \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o n\u1ed9i dung li\u1ec1n m\u1ea1ch, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, \u00e2m thanh d\u1ec5 nghe \u2013 \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 video l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"FcVidyRfYo3RwLxIOUDl9GFIgWb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OivmdOdCmonXsNxogYyloZ05gtf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1ed9t v\u00e0i l\u01b0u \u00fd x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng v\u00e0 duy tr\u00ec k\u00eanh TikTok.<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SQ1jd4jHvozeXcx3PThlFiDQgMd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u0103ng n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n<\/strong> T\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng l\u00e0 t\u1eeb 3 \u0111\u1ebfn 5 video m\u1ed7i tu\u1ea7n, ho\u1eb7c m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ee7 n\u1ed9i dung. Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e0i th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean s\u1ebd gi\u00fap TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u01a1n, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ea1o th\u00f3i quen theo d\u00f5i t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWdIdgjSsog4fmxL6xcl2iqfgkG\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Lu\u00f4n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt xu h\u01b0\u1edbng m\u1edbi (trend)<\/strong> Theo d\u00f5i m\u1ee5c &#8220;Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1&#8221; v\u00e0 c\u00e1c hashtag th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ec3 n\u1eafm b\u1eaft xu h\u01b0\u1edbng k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi. K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p xu h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung ri\u00eang gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e9t c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q0ObddWLro7vfuxS2uwl71Gggcd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a 3 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a video<\/strong> Ba gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u l\u00e0 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem c\u00f3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c xem video hay kh\u00f4ng. H\u00e3y g\u00e2y s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd b\u1eb1ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi g\u00e2y t\u00f2 m\u00f2 ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung b\u1ea5t ng\u1edd ngay t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PR8edoniAotpO1xhgZWlyJV4gQe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng caption v\u00e0 hashtag hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/strong> Caption n\u00ean ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, d\u1ec5 hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u00e8m theo l\u1eddi k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 \u201cXem \u0111\u1ebfn cu\u1ed1i nh\u00e9!\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201cB\u1ea1n ngh\u0129 sao?\u201d. Hashtag n\u00ean bao g\u1ed3m t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a ch\u00ednh, c\u00e1c hashtag \u0111ang th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 hashtag mang t\u00ednh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VjsmdqAemov3nFxCeoVl4Sb8gWe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Theo d\u00f5i s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh n\u1ed9i dung<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Pro \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, ngu\u1ed3n l\u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp,&#8230; Nh\u1eefng s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u n\u00e0y s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 h\u00e0nh vi kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ee3p l\u00fd.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UALzds6rpo9XzuxQc5eldQKigyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4a2aa3c7-5a64-4eed-bb93-f00f0f7def8a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTGbUb7yovo4e9kxxbqolBse9gEe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;TGbUb7yovo4e9kxxbqolBse9gEe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W0sLdC5Fiobv2yxiClVlbAvWgyd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgVadBUjzo1nfUxOLYtleu14gSf\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wm8WdWjQWoYfx7xfq4nlspi2gWe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GATZdqh8ooO5Hex2DsRlKwIWgmb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PTeAd1V4Eo6mqBxD7LslMLuiglb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ESdIdDvFCotWhUxZuyilHwP5gCe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>C\u00e1ch x\u00e2y k\u00eanh TikTok l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea1o, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok nh\u1eb1m m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 15 c\u00e1ch x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh TikTok nhanh ch\u00f3ng, d\u1ec5 l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, c\u00f9ng Lemon Digital\u00a0kh\u00e1m [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4757,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4086","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4086","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4086"}],"version-history":[{"count":16,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4086\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5168,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4086\/revisions\/5168"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4757"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4086"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4086"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4086"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}